# LightGBM's text model export format is line-based but not meant for line-ending
# normalization - Git converting LF to CRLF on Windows checkout corrupts it (breaks
# LightGBM's parser: "Model format error, expect a tree here"). Force these to be
# treated as opaque/binary so Git never touches their line endings.
part2/01_nyc_taxi_trip_prediction/models/*.txt -text
